  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YALI - Munzengu - Creditech</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: IT / Education .Beneficiaries: YALI Youth 105 of whom 53 are women. ..The grant will be used to help Congolese teachers to access the digital world and improve the quality education through awareness workshops with teachers and free training programs on basic computer literacy for teachers. Teachers will pay an affordable price in 6 monthly installments over the course of 6 months. The grant will fund Connect the Teacher pilot project which will impact 100 teachers of Minzoto primary school located at Lemba town in Kinshasa. ..The grant funds will be used to: (a) projector and materials needed to conduct trainings, (b) purchase of additional tablets and data bundles to increase stock for teachers; and (c) administrative support. .</narrative>
  </description>
